BEGIN_PGML Let [`f(x)=\sin(x)`] and let [`T_3(x)=c_0+c_1x+c_2x^2+c_3x^3\text{.}`] We find the values of [`c_0,\ldots,c_3`] that make the sine function and its derivative values agree with those of the cubic polynomial [`T_3`] at [`x=0\text{,}`] and observe patterns in the derivatives.
END_PGML
